message: "If you use Noetrium in research, please cite this software using these metadata."
title: "Noetrium: Reproducible Research Infrastructure for AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Noetrium contributors"
abstract: >-
  Noetrium is rigorous, evidence-driven infrastructure for reproducible
  AI-agent research across experiments, agents, models, environments,
  recovery, observability, artifacts, and verification.
version: "0.44.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xalzeroph/noetrium"
url: "https://github.com/Xalzeroph/noetrium"
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent research
  - reproducible research
  - research infrastructure
  - experiment management
  - evidence
  - verification
